<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ 28-day seasonal bills yield 7.342 pct at tender.</title>
<headline>NZ 28-day seasonal bills yield 7.342 pct at tender.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average successful yield on NZ$125 million of 28-day seasonal treasury bills at Tuesday's tender was 7.342 percent, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>Bids totalled NZ$385 million.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
